@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Sucursales, agentes y periodo inicial de pagos (mes actual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions/options

### México: pagos PA de agosto, no fecha de factura. Preliminar sin método 214.
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&branch=01&agent=all

### Todas las sucursales
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&branch=all&agent=all

### Agente existente en el catálogo verificado
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&branch=05&agent=1501

### Periodo vacío verificable
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions?from=1901-01-01&to=1901-01-31&branch=01&agent=all

### 400: rango invertido
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-08-31

### 400: no se admite filtrar por fecha de factura
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/reports/collection-commissions?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&invoiceFrom=2026-08-01
